        <mxCell id="v31" value="Continue only with a confirmed dataset mapping. Missing setup follows the channel-specific SXS process; an&#10;unavailable lookup remains pending. Reuse the dataset when adding a platform." parent="1" vertex="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=0;verticalAlign=top;align=left;fontSize=16;fontColor=#626262;">
